STEP 1. List any real words or numbers you can clearly read in the picture outside the upper-left typography. Universal symbols (Rx, $, %, +, arrows, check marks, a heart, a cross-free medical sign) are not words. Decorative marks, ticks, grid lines and texture are not text. If unsure, it is not text.
